{
  "id": "JHN.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 11",
  "verseCount": 57,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okhufwa khwaLazaro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omusaatsa undi yalwala, niye Lazaro oweBetsania, litaala liabwe Mariamu nende Maritsa omukhaana wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neniye Mariamu watsana owamubakha Omwami amafura niyeeya ebileniebie nende liswilie, owa Lazaro omusiani wabwe yalwala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abakhaana abo bamuupila omunwa, bari Omwami, lola, owa oheelanga nomulwale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Yesu yahulilakhwo, yasunga ari Obulwale buno shibuli obwokhufwa ta, habula obwoluyali lwaNyasaye, mbu Omwana waNyasaye aheebwe oluyali khulwabwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yesu yaheela Maritsa, nende omukhaana wabwe, nende Lazaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa yahulila shinga olwa ali omulwale, habwenaho yahongayo tsindaalo tsibili habundu yaho ewa yali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olunyumakhwo yasunjila abeechibe ari Chende khutsie ebuYahudi khandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeechibe nibamusunjila bari Rabi, ekulo abaYahudi babeele nibeenya okhukhulasa namachina; nawe otsiayo khandi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nakalusia ari Tsisaa tsieshiteere shitsili ekhumi natsibili? Omundu naba nachenda mushiteere shiyeesichirala ta, shichila alola obulafu bweshialo shino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne omundu naba nachenda mushilo, yeesichirala, shichila obulafu shibuli muye ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaboola amakhuwa ako; mana olunyumakhwo nabasunjila ari Omwitsa weefwe Lazaro akonanga; enzia mbu emubuusie mundoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abeechibe nibamusunjila bari Omwami, naba nakona tsindoolo, alahona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yesu yali nasunjile khukhufwakhwenabo nibakaala mbu aboolanga khukhuhuluushila mundoolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yesu nabasunjila habulafu, ari Lazaro umalile okhufwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasi esangaalile khulweenywe shinga olwa ndarabeeleho ta, mbu mana musuubile; nebutswa chende khutsie ewa ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Tomasi, owalangwa mbu Mukhwana, yasunjila abeechi bashie ari Chende khutsie neefu, mbu khufwe ninaye halala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu niye Obulamushi khandi nende Obulamu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa Yesu yoolayo yanyoola mbu umalile okhukona mung'ani tsindaalo tsine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Betsania yali ahambikhwo nende Yerusalemu, oluchendo shinga olwetsimailo tsibili; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabanji abokhubaYahudi bali nibeetsile ewabo Maritsa nende Mariamu, okhubalemia emioyo khumakhuwa komusiani wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana olwa Maritsa yahulila mbu Yesu yeetsa, yarula namubukaanila; naye Mariamu yali nashiikhaale munzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Maritsa nasunjila Yesu ari Omwami, olaba niwakhabeeleho, khane omusiani weefwe shiyakhafwile ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kata bulaano emanyile mbu shiosi shiosi eshia olasaba Nyasaye, Nyasaye alakhuheelesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namuboolela ari Omusiani weenywe alalamukha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maritsa namusunjila ari Emanyile mbu alilamukha khandi mubulamushi bwokhunyanga yobumaliilishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namusunjila ari Isie nisie obulamushi, khandi nende obulamu; ousuubilila isie, kata olwa afwa, ne alaba omulamu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "khandi ouli omulamu nasuubilila isie, shialifwakhwo tawe, obushia nobushia. Osuubila orio? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye namukalusia mbu Toto, Omwami; emalile okhusuubila shinga olwa oli Kristo watsana, Omwana waNyasaye, omwenoyo owitsa mushialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu yalila amasika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali nasunjile ario, yatsia nalanga Mariamu omukhaana wabwe masilisi, ari Omwechesia aliho; akhulanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye olwa yahulila ario, yasinjila bwangu, natsia ewa yali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Yesu yali nashili okhwinjila mwitaala, ne yali nashili habwenaho ewa Maritsa yamubukaanila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abaYahudi abali nibali ninaye munzu, nibamulemia omwoyo, olwa balola shinga Mariamu olwa yasmjila bwangu narula, nibamulondakhwo, nibakaala mbu atsia khushilindwa okhwikhuulayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho olwa Mariamu yoola ewa Yesu yali, namulola, yakwa mumakuluke, namusunjila ari Omwami, olaba niwakhabeeleho, khane omusiani weefwe shiyakhafwile ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa Yesu yamulola niyeekhuula, nende abaYahudi aba yeetsa ninabo, nabo nibeekhuula bario, nashenya mumwoyo, naba mubunyakhani obunji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nareeba ari Mwamuyabiile heena? Nibamusunjila bari Omwami, yitsa olole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nalila amasika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho aba Yahudi nibaboola bari Lolekhwo shinga olwa yamuheela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abandi khubo nibaboola bari Omundu uno owatimbusi tsimoni tsiomubofu, shiyakhanyalile okhuchila omundu uno oburafwa ta?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lazaro yalamusibwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Yesu nashenya mumwoyokwe khandi, niyoola khushilindwa. Nashio shiali imbinga, lichina nalio niliareelwekhwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nasunga mbu Murusiekhwo lichina. Maritsa, omukhaana wabwe omufu, namusunjila ari Omwami bulaano ahunya; akhuba netsindaalo tsine nafwile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu namusunjila ari Shikhubooleele mbu noba nosuubila, wakhalola oluyali lwaNyasaye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibarusiakhwo lichina. Yesu nachinguula tsimoni, nasunga mbu Papa, ekhuupila orio muno shinga olwa umbuliile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne emanyile mbu umbulilanga tsindaalo tsiosi; habula khulwa emikanda chiabo abasinjiileho emboolile likhuwa elo, mbu basuubile shinga olwa waruma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yali naboolile ario, yalanga nende omwoyo omukhongo, ari Lazaro, rulamwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omufu oyo narula, naboyilwe amakhono nebilenje nende isanda eyeing'ani, naboyilwe eshitambaya mumoni. Yesu nababiila ari Mumuboholole, atsie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abeemilisi basaniila Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho abanji abokhubaYahudi abali nibeetsile ewaMariamu, nibalola aka Yesu yakhola, bamusuubilila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebutswa abandi khubo batsia ewabaFarisayo nibababoolela amakhuwa aka Yesu yali nakholile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abakhulundu babakuhani nende abaFarisayo nibakhung'aasia eshiina, nibasunga bari Khukhole khurie? Okhuba omundu uno akholanga ebilolelo ebinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikhuba nikhumulekha khurio, abandu bosi balamusuubilila; mana abaRoma baleetsa nibakhubukula habundu weefwe nende lihanga lieefwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oundi khubo, mbu Kayafa, owali Omukuhani Omukhulundu omuyika kwenokwo, yabasunjila ari Shimumanyile likhuwa liosi ta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kata shimwitsulila shinga olwa kakaasa mbu omundu mulala afwile abandu bosi, lihanga liosi lileshe okhutiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne shiyasunga ako khululwe ta; habula olwa yali Omukuhani Omukhulundu omuyika okwo, yalakula mbu Yesu yakhafwila lihanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne shikhwali khulwa lihanga elo lionyene ta, habula mbu akhung'aasie halala abaana baNyasaye abali nibasalaanile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho okhurula khunyanga eyo bamusanjilila mbu bamwire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.53"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yesu shiyachenda ebulafu mubaYahudi khandi ta, ne yeenyokha natsia mushibala eshiali ahambi nende eshitsiimi, mwitaala elilangwa mbu Efuraimu; niyeekhalayo halala nende abeechi abo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Pasaka yabaYahudi yali ahambi; abanji nibarula mushibala nibatikulukha nibatsia eYerusalemu Pasaka niyishili, mbu beesiiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho nibamukhaaba Yesu, nibasungana abeene nabeene nibasinjiile muhekalu, bari Mupaara murie? Mbu shialeetsa khwisabo ta? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 11:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne abakhulundu babakuhani nende abaFarisayo bali nibalachilisiye mbu omundu yesi naba namanya ewa ali, abuule, mbu mana bamuhambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.11.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.11.57"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
